DejaVuSans.ttf is vendored so that the rendering tests produce byte-identical
images on every machine. It is not shipped with the service and is used only by
the test suite.

DejaVu fonts are released under a permissive Bitstream Vera derived licence:
https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html

Fonts are (c) Bitstream (Bitstream Vera) and (c) Tavmjong Bah (DejaVu changes).
Bitstream Vera is a trademark of Bitstream, Inc.
